  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Midweight Thermal Knit Bottom provides exceptional warmth and comfort during colder months, making it a perfect base layer for outdoor activities or everyday wear. Crafted from a high-performance polyester / cotton blend, these thermal bottoms offer breathability while trapping body heat, keeping you warm without feeling bulky. The elastic waistband ensures a secure, comfortable fit that moves with you throughout the day. Its lightweight design enhances mobility while still providing the insulation you need in cool conditions. The tag-less label adds to the overall comfort, eliminating any irritation on your skin. Pair it with Rothco's matching thermal tops for full-body warmth. Whether you're out for a hike, working outdoors, or simply lounging at home, Rothco&rsquo;s Midweight Thermal Knit Bottom is your go-to for reliable cold-weather wear.</p>",
